              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Find Foton on this computer, install it if needed, and check that it can use the GPU.

Most people connect nothing but a Boolean Toggle to _check. The first time, set install_ to True: Foton is installed into its own folder (~/.foton), with its own Python if this computer has none. Nothing outside that folder changes. After that, Check reports the Foton version and the GPU it will use.</item>
