              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Run a daylight factor study on the GPU for every sensor grid in a Honeybee model.

Daylight factor is the light indoors under an overcast sky, as a percentage of the light outdoors. It needs no weather file. Results are written in the same layout as Honeybee's Daylight Factor recipe. Pair DF with the grid meshes in LB Spatial Heatmap to see it on the model.</item>
                    <item name="GraftStandardOutputLines" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                    <item name="IconOverride" type_name="gh_drawing_bitmap" type_code="37">
                      <bitmap length="1598"></bitmap>
                    </item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">6c3aa51e-3b1d-4eab-9676-93fdd5fbc524</item>
                    <item name="MarshGuids" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
