                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Foton 0.3.3: GPU daylight for Grasshopper.
1. First time only: set install_ on Foton Settings to True. Foton installs into ~/.foton, with its own Python if needed.
2. Toggle _check: it should name your GPU.
3. Toggle _run on Foton Annual Daylight or Foton Daylight Factor.
Turn live_ on for quick updates while you move sliders. Hover over any input for help. Guide: START_HERE.md</item>
